---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout lang="en" title="About — Felipe Cepluki" description="About Felipe Cepluki." back>
  <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto pb-8">

    <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight mb-8 fade-up">
      <span class="bg-gradient-to-r from-[#00c8ff] to-[#8b5cf6] bg-clip-text text-transparent">about</span>
    </h1>

    <div class="space-y-4 text-muted text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed fade-up delay-1">
      <p>
        Hey, I'm Felipe — founder of <a href="https://www.equilibrioailabs.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-foreground hover:text-[#00c8ff] transition-colors underline underline-offset-4 decoration-border">Equilibrio AI Labs</a>, based in Curitiba, PR, Brazil.
      </p>
      <p>
        I build apps and tools that solve real problems for real people — products I'd use myself, made with care in every detail.
      </p>
      <p>
        I believe well-crafted technology changes lives. That's why I've started companies, shipped open-source projects, and keep building things with purpose.
      </p>
      <p>
        Outside of code, I'm vegan and have bipolar disorder — two important parts of who I am that have shaped a lot of how I see the world and build for people.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-10 pt-6 border-t border-border fade-up delay-2">
      <a href="mailto:cepluki.felipe@protonmail.com" class="group inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-muted hover:text-[#00c8ff] transition-colors">
        cepluki.felipe@protonmail.com
        <span class="group-hover:translate-x-0.5 transition-transform">→</span>
      </a>
    </div>

  </div>
</Layout>
